+ *       set_md_smem_remap       @ 0xc053011c: str ..., [r3, #0x308/#0x30c]
+ *                                            str ..., [r3, #0x318/#0x31c]
+ *       set_md_rom_rw_mem_remap @ 0xc05303b4: str ..., [r3, #0x300/#0x304]
+ *                                            str ..., [r3, #0x310/#0x314]
